+/* -- The Orkmaster's lane (goal 170 stage D, decisions §293.2; the mockup docs/mockups/desktop-look/ `.lane.om`): three parts one over the other, *Waits for you*, *Goals*, *At work*, each drawn only when it has a card; the cards are table/post.js's posts, whole, pinned, never a list. The lane scrolls
